WEBVTT

00:28.100 --> 00:29.340
<b><i>The Heavy Knight.</i></b>

00:29.420 --> 00:37.520
Heavy Knight

00:31.030 --> 00:37.520
<b><i>It is a class specialized in defense that 
draws enemy attacks to protect allies.</i></b>

00:38.570 --> 00:43.960
<b><i>But compared to other 
defensive classes, it lacks versatility.</i></b>

00:45.030 --> 00:49.440
<b><i>Its incredibly weak offensive abilities 
make it difficult to level up.</i></b>

00:52.700 --> 00:55.910
As a result

00:53.070 --> 00:54.610
<b><i>As a result...</i></b>

00:55.770 --> 00:59.740
<b><i>it's known as a truly 
unfortunate defective class.</i></b>

02:34.180 --> 02:37.970
<b>Episode 1\h\h\h\h\hElymas the Heavy Knight</b>

02:47.580 --> 02:52.140
<b><i>Every time I've learned 
or seen something...</i></b>

03:00.050 --> 03:04.630
<b><i>I've always felt like
 I already knew what it was.</i></b>

03:06.610 --> 03:10.550
<b><i>Huh? I get the sense 
I've seen this before.</i></b>

04:06.040 --> 04:08.310
<b>Doppellusion!</b>

04:07.270 --> 04:08.310
<b>Doppellusion</b>

04:09.590 --> 04:13.520
<b>I'll show you what 
a Master Swordsman can do!</b>

04:14.280 --> 04:17.030
<b>Cold-As-Steel Cutter!</b>

05:06.280 --> 05:07.920
<b><i>And today...</i></b>

05:09.270 --> 05:11.660
<b><i>I was about to undertake</i></b>

05:11.660 --> 05:14.640
<b><i>the vital Ritual of Divine Blessing 
as heir to the Edvaughn family.</i></b>

05:14.640 --> 05:16.120
<b>It's finally time.</b>

05:14.640 --> 05:16.610
<b>I'm nervous, too.</b>

05:16.610 --> 05:18.380
<b>He's so gallant.</b>

05:19.010 --> 05:22.040
<b><i>There's that odd feeling of déjà vu again.</i></b>

05:23.390 --> 05:25.020
<b>It's all right, Elymas.</b>

05:25.020 --> 05:28.890
<b>You're my son. 
Have faith in the God of the Sword.</b>

05:35.950 --> 05:38.000
<b>Elymas Edvaughn.</b>

05:44.030 --> 05:47.060
<b>I grant you the divine 
blessing of a class.</b>

05:49.420 --> 05:50.840
<b>Baptisma.</b>

05:49.530 --> 05:51.280
<b>Baptisma</b>

05:49.530 --> 05:51.280
<b>Baptisma</b>

05:52.610 --> 05:55.160
<b><i>I recognize this.</i></b>

05:55.160 --> 05:57.290
<b><i>Five years ago—no, before that...</i></b>

05:57.820 --> 06:00.750
<b><i>Before I was even born...</i></b>

06:02.830 --> 06:07.510
<b><i>I obsessively played an online 
VR game called </i>Magic World<i>,</i></b>

06:07.510 --> 06:10.360
<b><i>and this world is exactly like that!</i></b>

06:12.640 --> 06:15.950
<b><i>It's hard to believe, 
but I've been reincarnated.</i></b>

06:16.560 --> 06:20.680
<b><i>With everything I know about the game, 
I'm guaranteed happiness and success.</i></b>

06:21.140 --> 06:26.160
<b><i>If that's the case, 
I hope I get my favorite class.</i></b>

06:28.160 --> 06:31.830
<b><i>That broken class said to be 
the strongest in </i>Magic World<i>.</i></b>

