<b>Master Swordsman, yes? 
That's what you said, yes?!</b>

07:01.140 --> 07:02.060
<b>What?</b>

07:08.510 --> 07:10.990
<b><i>I mixed up my memories 
from my past and present!</i></b>

07:11.490 --> 07:14.860
<b><i>In this world, simple and powerful 
classes are celebrated,</i></b>

07:14.860 --> 07:17.500
<b><i>while technical classes that take time 
to blossom are regarded poorly.</i></b>

07:18.710 --> 07:22.950
<b><i>Their analysis and testing of classes 
must be lagging behind.</i></b>

07:23.840 --> 07:25.560
<b>Actually, um...</b>

07:25.560 --> 07:26.940
<b>Show me.</b>

07:29.260 --> 07:32.010
<b>Heavy Knight? What's the meaning of this?!</b>

07:32.540 --> 07:37.270
<b>With low stats across the board 
and no decent attack skills, it's useless!</b>

07:37.590 --> 07:40.520
<b>Without a doubt, it's a defective class!</b>

07:40.520 --> 07:42.350
<b>Father, please calm down.</b>

07:42.350 --> 07:44.110
<b>It has the highest HP and Defense.</b>

07:44.110 --> 07:46.860
<b>I don't care about that!</b>

07:57.010 --> 07:58.580
<b>I'm glad this happened here.</b>

07:58.580 --> 08:02.840
<b>The Edvaughns would be ruined if 
we'd been publicly embarrassed like this.</b>

08:25.070 --> 08:26.420
<b>I almost didn't recognize her.</b>

08:26.420 --> 08:28.280
<b>She's so beautiful now.</b>

08:29.070 --> 08:30.070
<b>Who is she?</b>

08:30.780 --> 08:32.290
<b>She's beautiful.</b>

08:32.580 --> 08:33.580
<b>She's from a branch family.</b>

08:33.580 --> 08:35.100
<b>The daughter of a branch family, huh?</b>

08:43.880 --> 08:49.360
<b>I'm supposed to undergo the 
Ritual of Divine Blessing as well. May I?</b>

08:46.150 --> 08:49.210
<b>Who does she think she is?</b>

08:49.210 --> 08:51.060
<b>She should know her place.</b>

08:51.060 --> 08:54.060
<b><i>She's the daughter 
of an Edvaughn branch family.</i></b>

08:54.060 --> 08:55.800
<b><i>Her name is Malice.</i></b>

08:56.510 --> 08:59.240
<b><i>We played together 
a few times as children,</i></b>

08:59.600 --> 09:04.820
<b><i>but in part due to her status, we've 
hardly spoken in the last five years.</i></b>

09:00.080 --> 09:02.260
<b>They grow up so fast.</b>

09:02.460 --> 09:04.440
<b>She's so brazen.</b>

09:07.490 --> 09:09.710
<b>B-But currently...</b>

09:09.710 --> 09:12.800
<b>It's fine. Begin the ritual.</b>

09:19.150 --> 09:21.330
<b><i>I've got a bad feeling about this.</i></b>

