<b>I seem to have taken all the skill.</b>

10:17.910 --> 10:20.190
<b><i>My bad feeling came true.</i></b>

10:21.150 --> 10:24.370
<b><i>A branch family's daughter acquiring 
the Master Swordsman class</i></b>

10:24.370 --> 10:26.710
<b><i>could worsen my father's 
already terrible mood.</i></b>

10:31.690 --> 10:35.840
<b>Splendid, Malice!
I knew you were a true Edvaughn.</b>

10:35.840 --> 10:39.660
<b>Malice, as of today, you are my daughter.</b>

10:39.660 --> 10:41.950
<b>You will be my heir.</b>

10:43.890 --> 10:45.940
<b>He named a branch family girl his heir?</b>

10:48.350 --> 10:50.520
<b>It's not as though it's without precedent.</b>

10:50.520 --> 10:55.430
<b>Father, I always thought
 that Lord Elymas... no.</b>

10:56.680 --> 11:00.970
<b>That <i>Elymas</i> could not bear 
the burden of being your heir.</b>

11:01.470 --> 11:02.160
<b><i>What?</i></b>

11:02.160 --> 11:03.870
<b>Begone, Elymas.</b>

11:04.310 --> 11:08.540
<b>You disappointed me. 
You are no longer my son!</b>

11:08.540 --> 11:12.190
<b>A Heavy Knight is a stain 
on the Edvaughns' reputation!</b>

11:12.190 --> 11:14.950
<b>Leave this mansion at once!</b>

11:19.530 --> 11:21.540
<b>It's the wise choice.</b>

11:21.540 --> 11:22.550
<b>Lord Elymas...</b>

11:22.550 --> 11:24.680
<b>It can't be helped.</b>

11:23.790 --> 11:25.960
<b>He's adopting the branch family girl?</b>

11:24.710 --> 11:27.540
<b>F-Father, surely you don't mean that!</b>

11:28.010 --> 11:30.540
<b>Heavy Knight is a strong class!</b>

11:30.540 --> 11:31.740
<b>I promise I'll bring honor to—</b>

11:31.740 --> 11:33.060
<b>Silence!</b>

11:33.380 --> 11:35.730
<b>This is exactly what you deserve!</b>

11:35.730 --> 11:37.630
<b>Don't show your face here again!</b>

11:37.980 --> 11:40.690
<b>Don't use the Edvaughn 
family name outside these walls.</b>

11:40.690 --> 11:44.640
<b>If you do, I'll have your head!</b>

11:52.550 --> 11:53.560
<b>Father!</b>

11:57.660 --> 11:59.080
<b>Clean this up.</b>

12:21.670 --> 12:25.650
<b><i>My father refused to listen to me.</i></b>

12:22.800 --> 12:24.310
<b>It's not much.</b>

12:24.310 --> 12:24.960
<b>It's fine.</b>

12:24.960 --> 12:27.670
<b>I'm sorry I couldn't do anything for you.</b>

12:26.350 --> 12:32.600
<b><i>I was given a few coins and 
kicked out of the mansion that day.</i></b>

12:28.790 --> 12:29.900
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:31.670 --> 12:33.060
<b>Lord Elymas?</b>

13:22.700 --> 13:24.850
<b>Should we recruit party members?</b>

13:25.470 --> 13:28.190
<b>Anyone will do, as long as 
they're a fast offensive class.</b>

13:32.120 --> 13:33.460
<b>How have you been?</b>

13:33.890 --> 13:37.250
<b>I'm planning to take on 
a promotion quest soon.</b>

13:37.250 --> 13:39.660
<b>I've got some pull with the examiners.</b>

13:38.730 --> 13:40.310
<b>Wow.</b>

13:39.660 --> 13:41.590
<b>Lord Teal's second to none!</b>

13:45.350 --> 13:49.360
<b>Today's the day! 
Today, I'll do my very best!</b>

13:49.930 --> 13:51.160
<b>Yeah!</b>

13:51.560 --> 13:54.330
<b>Just don't get in the way.</b>

13:54.330 --> 13:56.820
<b>I wish you could at least hunt normally.</b>

14:11.760 --> 14:14.980
<b>My husband's great 
in public, but at home...</b>

14:14.980 --> 14:16.410
<b>That's just men.</b>

14:20.290 --> 14:22.880
<b><i>My piece of shit father 
put me through hell.</i></b>

14:24.020 --> 14:29.100
<b><i>I lost my home, my family, 
and my life, but...</i></b>

14:29.540 --> 14:32.850
<b><i>I've still got Heavy Knight, 
the strongest class.</i></b>

14:37.510 --> 14:39.020
<b><i>That said...</i></b>

14:39.340 --> 14:44.420
<b><i>This world's history, environment, 
and even this city's name of Rondalm,</i></b>

14:44.420 --> 14:46.660
<b><i>are nothing like the game.</i></b>

14:47.400 --> 14:50.200
<b><i>I'll have to do some research.</i></b>

