<b>Come at me! Rampart Reflection!</b>

20:33.980 --> 20:35.360
<b>What?!</b>

20:39.960 --> 20:41.140
<b>Defense</b>

20:41.140 --> 20:43.730
<b><i>I'm already familiar with starter enemies.</i></b>

20:44.140 --> 20:48.290
<b><i>And I boosted my defense with 
skill tree bonuses and equipment.</i></b>

20:49.490 --> 20:51.190
<b><i>When it comes to fighting Raana...</i></b>

20:51.610 --> 20:54.440
<b><i>I can beat dozens of them!</i></b>

20:57.880 --> 20:59.820
<b>What?!</b>

21:08.050 --> 21:12.330
<b>You beat that many Raana? Wh-Who are you?</b>

21:13.830 --> 21:16.090
<b>I'm Elymas Edvau...</b>

21:16.090 --> 21:18.730
<b>Don't use the Edvaughn family name 
outside these walls.</b>

21:18.730 --> 21:22.510
<b>If you do, I'll have your head!</b>

21:22.970 --> 21:25.140
<b>Sorry.</b>

21:29.160 --> 21:30.020
<b>No...</b>

21:34.030 --> 21:37.430
<b>I'm Elymas the Heavy Knight.</b>

21:37.980 --> 21:39.990
I'm Elymas
 the Heavy Knight.

23:11.380 --> 23:15.120
<b><i>I won my first battle as a Heavy Knight.</i></b>

23:15.520 --> 23:19.000
<b><i>It's still the strongest class, 
just like it was in the game.</i></b>

23:19.510 --> 23:24.380
<b><i>But I need to level up to really shine.</i></b>

23:24.380 --> 23:27.180
<b><i>I can't waste time here.</i></b>

23:27.710 --> 23:32.770
<b><i>That's when a horrible monster 
double my level appears before me.</i></b>

23:32.770 --> 23:34.770
<b><i>Next time, "The Menacing Monkey Spider."</i></b>

23:35.020 --> 23:37.960
<b><i>This battle isn't unwinnable!</i></b>
